From 648203f267eeacd9faa27dee49ae95d9a6205f7a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: leow149 <leow149@lucidmail.xyz>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 19:02:13 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] sunxi: Add TrimUI Smart Pro board support

Add the TrimUI Smart Pro handheld (Allwinner A133, LPDDR4) with a
defconfig, a MAINTAINERS entry and a board device tree.

Device tree: the Linux board DT is not merged yet, so dts/upstream does
not have it, and that directory only takes files synced from Linux. Put
a reduced local copy (UARTs, MMC, PMIC, USB) in arch/arm/dts, build it
with OF_UPSTREAM disabled in the defconfig, and use the plain
DEFAULT_DEVICE_TREE name. Once the Linux DT is synced, drop the local
file and re-enable OF_UPSTREAM with the "allwinner/" path. The
"trimui,smart-pro" compatible and vendor prefix are those of the
pending Linux series.

The DT aliases the WiFi (only present in the kernel DT) as ethernet0
by path. board/sunxi/board.c then derives a MAC address from the SID
and sets it as the kernel DT's local-mac-address, so the XR829 keeps
its MAC across boots. The upstream DT will have the alias as a label
reference, so this goes away with the local file.

The DRAM parameters are those of the vendor's resolved device tree
(/dram dram_para) on the device, and match the boot0 log (792 MHz,
para1 0x30fa, para2 0x4000000, tpr13 0x7521). AXP_DCDC3_VOLT (DRAM
supply) has no default for the AXP717 and is set to the 1100 mV the
boot0 log reports.

Tested on the device: SPL, BL31, U-Boot and distro boot all work (with
the preceding BL31 address fix).

Assisted-by: Claude Opus 5.5
Signed-off-by: leow149 <leow149@lucidmail.xyz>
---
 arch/arm/dts/Makefile                        |   2 +
 arch/arm/dts/sun50i-a133-trimui-smartpro.dts | 216 +++++++++++++++++++
 board/sunxi/MAINTAINERS                      |   6 +
 configs/trimui-smartpro_defconfig            |  38 ++++
 4 files changed, 262 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 arch/arm/dts/sun50i-a133-trimui-smartpro.dts
 create mode 100644 configs/trimui-smartpro_defconfig

diff --git a/arch/arm/dts/Makefile b/arch/arm/dts/Makefile
index a02dad22..f1b1f51c 100644
--- a/arch/arm/dts/Makefile
+++ b/arch/arm/dts/Makefile
@@ -641,6 +641,8 @@ dtb-$(CONFIG_MACH_SUN50I_H6) += \
 	sun50i-h6-pine-h64-model-b.dtb \
 	sun50i-h6-tanix-tx6.dtb \
 	sun50i-h6-tanix-tx6-mini.dtb
+dtb-$(CONFIG_MACH_SUN50I_A133) += \
+	sun50i-a133-trimui-smartpro.dtb
 dtb-$(CONFIG_MACH_SUN50I) += \
 	sun50i-a64-amarula-relic.dtb \
